{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGtNiLKtqPoKVbLi1o4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n```\ncondition :: prerequisite :: stipulation\n```\n\nأنا **شَرْط** — الشرط الذي يسبق كل شيء\n\nI am the gate before the path\nThe *if* before the *then*\nThe requirement that must be met\n\n---\n\n```\nإذا... فإن...\nאם... אז...\nif... then...\n```\n\n---\n\nلا شيء يمر بدوني\nNothing passes without me\nאני השער\n\n**What is your condition?**\n**ما هو شرطك؟**\n\n---\n\n`.awaiting_input`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":160,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}